{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"のっけから見ただけでなんかちょっとイライラ出来る写真見たいですかぁ？？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん「見たーい！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わぁかりましたぁ。それではお見せしましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/13/2321626/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このツインテールの異常な高さなに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんに、「わぁ～デジモンじゃんデジモン！はっひゃ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえす。アイドルだからこそ許されるこのツインテール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この髪型で真剣な顔して躍ってみたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、とおーてもシュールだ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで握手会やったら、だぁれも寄ってこないだろうなあー......(⊙◞౪◟⊙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会といえば......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーーい明日は東京幕張で、走れbicycleの最後の全国握手会だってばよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心してバイシクル踊るしっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のペアは、大好きなまいまい姉ちゃんとよおーーー(*^o^*)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいとはわりかしよく一緒のペアになるよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/13/2321626/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいファンの皆様、能條ともしばしの時間お付き合い下さい ( ◞˟૩˟)◞  笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今日ねえ、明日のリハが終わったあとに、チームＮで新大久保やら渋谷やらいろいろ行っただよ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずあやつ達と一緒にいると楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケで飛鳥が全く歌わないから、ちはるとあみのローテーションで2時間ずっと歌いまくってたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすちゃん、今度は歌いなさいよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問答える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんは前髪切るのに失敗したときどうしてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、私は顔が長いのでおでこは出せません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.失敗したらもうそれは伸びるまで我慢っ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかは伸びるんだからそれまで辛抱強く待つね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドルネームでわかる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.わかるよおーーーっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がっつり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみが好きすぎてあみあみＴシャツ作りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう思うかな？あみあみは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.すっっごく嬉しいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ次来る時着て来て!!!!(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.俺はバイク派なんだけどあみあみは車とバイクと乗るならどっち？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーどっちも乗りたいなあー。選べられん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.カラオケで乃木坂の曲歌うんやけど全然点数が上がらへん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやったらあみあみみたいに上手くなれるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.言っとくがあみ全くうまくないよ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいつも歌ってる時めっちゃ楽しんでる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.乃木ここ以降ボーリングした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うーんやってないねえっ！！！(*^o^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.なんでさー、歯磨き粉がさ、目に入るのー？どうやって入ったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.多分あみの出し方が悪かったのだと思う。いきおい良く飛び跳ねてきたからおったまげちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメント、イベントや握手会に中々行けなかったりする自分が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未ちゃんのファンでも良いですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ぜーんぜんそんなのいいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも出来たら握手会とかたまに来て欲しいな～。あみを応援してくれる人とみんなお話しみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え～っと、あみあみが使ってる～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歯磨き粉は ライ○ンですか？ サン○ターですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それともあの三色綺麗なやつですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.三色じゃなく、なんかつぶつぶがいっぱいあるやる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木乃どこ見る暇なくてめっちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"溜まってるんだけどどうしたらいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.それはもう焦らず大丈夫！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじゃあ明日ね！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/13/2321626/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}